commit: 4accf9dba4b620951af014089c3e07343da45200
abstract: >-
  A Taiga-published experiment dated 11 July 2026 records six implementations
  of one frozen invoice-service specification: three Claude Code runs and
  three GitHub Copilot CLI runs. The source-assisted security review dated
  18 July found none safe to deploy as shipped. The 11 October rerun rechecked
  the existing outputs without new model calls and preserves raw acceptance
  scores separately from the July manual regrade. This is not independent
  replication, a customer outcome or a test of Taiga's software factory.
  Documentation and analysis are CC BY 4.0; no license is granted or implied
  for generated code in runs/.
